{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>打鼓嶺今早（26日）發生奪命交通意外，一輛專線小巴在文錦渡路近紅橋新村，撞到一名單車漢；69歲蔡姓騎單車男子頭部重傷，送院搶救後不治。警方表示，74歲古姓小巴男司機，涉嫌「危險駕駛引致他人死亡」被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"小巴司機被捕，帶上警車。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147103838499508224251806.jpeg/XR8ZxspNl9GE5ExX_OGjY4vzaGOtUVkyI0PEXiNDxF4\"/><figcaption>小巴司機被捕，帶上警車。</figcaption></figure><p>事發在今日早上6時27分，一輛專線小巴沿文錦渡路往上水方方向行駛，途至近紅橋新村時，疑收掣不及，撞向一輛由紅橋新村路口駛出的單車。69歲蔡姓騎單車男子頭部重傷，陷於昏迷，由救護車送往北區醫院搶救後，早上6時59分不治。小巴上一名43歲小巴女乘客腰部疼痛，清醒被送往北區醫院治理。</p><p>新界北總區交通部特別調查隊正跟進調查案件。警方呼籲，任何人如目睹意外發生或有資料提供，請致電3661 3800與調查人員聯絡。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事單車停在現場。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147087592647299072234910.jpeg/lPtvxXh2C5HrPyknFCnCuf-bV5dvFCtWUhtz9lIbc_Y\"/><figcaption>涉事單車停在現場。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小巴左邊車頭撞到單車，事後警方貼上黑膠袋。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147088187361857536056187.jpeg/U3ZvczA2fxweOc7roDi3309UoqJFh90ojR7lXY0e5V0\"/><figcaption>小巴左邊車頭撞到單車，事後警方貼上黑膠袋。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147102925865095168926014.jpeg/TAft8LEuDj-mQZ-PTnQIzzTQJFn_yDPOysgKCsrICgo\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是文錦渡路。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147093007275659264246193.jpeg/uGmbSHMiQok3nM1FBqEdJ-c1deThrdnSucLVbrnC1W4\"/><figcaption>現場是文錦渡路。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"單車由右邊的讓線駛出時，被小巴撞到。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147094792941867008864725.jpeg/9XE2pKT5dknRoVlkjQ3HZT-SslBlxoR0js2-n47Nvp8\"/><figcaption>單車由右邊的讓線駛出時，被小巴撞到。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小巴倒後鏡損毀。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147093011017109504361579.jpeg/i2TZ6BqHidBo4GwAQtRAB64QTPCzQztfo6AjI6OgIyM\"/><figcaption>小巴倒後鏡損毀。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方檢取事主的單車。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147093015261876224285109.jpeg/BG0t0jXzYXGmbTkLMOf0n_cD_Lj9ErldmCq8ZJgqvGQ\"/><figcaption>警方檢取事主的單車。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在文錦渡路調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147096298998992896148205.jpeg/47wBTN2ZMbREYeytTGtHE8rpvI5elyHQAR4vQwEeL0M\"/><figcaption>警方在文錦渡路調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在文錦渡路調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147096301943525376829716.jpeg/6XaymTnUE-edAO6IxBO9TXQNKdV4s49VEE-mAxBPpgM\"/><figcaption>警方在文錦渡路調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"單車由右邊的讓線駛出時，被小巴撞到。現場舖上防滑沙。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147096304628011008174950.jpeg/4IcELM6B6sGyTw2-FCzX4RYemuuBKtQwQL0DqkC9A6o\"/><figcaption>單車由右邊的讓線駛出時，被小巴撞到。現場舖上防滑沙。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是文錦渡路。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147096307304108032267085.jpeg/AiBq1CsoFao0hPCrE2eyARRTsI6_xSuAtjSTYLY0k2A\"/><figcaption>現場是文錦渡路。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方檢走涉事單車。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147091538291986432649215.jpeg/cJbZapKrr8F1dnSoPBdcWsaliKcEmmcw3MSigtzEooI\"/><figcaption>警方檢走涉事單車。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-26T04:19:51.227015+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":505,"images":13,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}